---
const base = [1, 2, 3, 4];
const fin = [1, 2];
---
<section class="sec" id="cv-to-site"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="eyebrow">Before and after</span><h2>From a 4-page CV to a <em>live site.</em></h2><p>Muhammed Mehdi Hasan Chowdhury's career filled four pages, with the strongest results buried in long paragraphs. We kept the career, tightened it to a two-page CV, and built his live site from it.</p></div>
  <div class="cvx">
    <div class="cvx-col">
      <div class="cvx-label"><span>Base CV</span><b>4 pages</b></div>
      <div class="cvx-pages p4">
        {base.map((n) => (
          <button type="button" class="cvx-pg" data-full={`/cv/base-${n}.webp`} data-alt={`Base CV, page ${n} of 4`} aria-label={`Enlarge base CV, page ${n} of 4`}><img src={`/cv/base-${n}.webp`} alt={`Base CV, page ${n} of 4`} width="900" height="1165" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span>{n}</span></button>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cvx-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M4 12h16M14 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></div>
    <div class="cvx-col">
      <div class="cvx-label"><span>Final CV</span><b>2 pages</b></div>
      <div class="cvx-pages p2">
        {fin.map((n) => (
          <button type="button" class="cvx-pg" data-full={`/cv/final-${n}.webp`} data-alt={`Final CV, page ${n} of 2`} aria-label={`Enlarge final CV, page ${n} of 2`}><img src={`/cv/final-${n}.webp`} alt={`Final CV, page ${n} of 2`} width="900" height="1165" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span>{n}</span></button>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="cvx-note">Tap a page to enlarge. Personal details are hidden.</p>

  <div class="cvx-clip">
    <div class="cvx-label"><span>The live site</span><b>mhchowdhury.netlify.app</b></div>
    <video controls muted playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/video/mehdi-site-poster.webp" width="950" height="420" aria-label="Screen recording scrolling through Mehdi Hasan Chowdhury's live executive portfolio website">
      <source src="/video/mehdi-site.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
    </video>
  </div>
  <dialog class="cvx-box" id="cvx-box" aria-label="Enlarged CV page"><button type="button" class="cvx-close" aria-label="Close">Close</button><img alt="" /></dialog>
</div></section>
<script>
  const box = document.getElementById('cvx-box') as HTMLDialogElement | null;
  if (box) {
    const img = box.querySelector('img')!;
    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.cvx-pg').forEach((b) => b.addEventListener('click', () => {
      img.src = b.dataset.full || ''; img.alt = b.dataset.alt || ''; box.showModal();
    }));
    box.querySelector('.cvx-close')?.addEventListener('click', () => box.close());
    box.addEventListener('click', (e) => { if (e.target === box) box.close(); });
  }
</script>
